    <h1>Stepan Sazonov</h1>
  </header>
  <div class="prose-body">
    <p>I live in Yekaterinburg. I write numerical solvers for nonlinear dynamics in magnetic chains, and I work in film.</p>
    <p>Film, series, interactive exhibitions and narrative design happen at <a href="https://kmbnt.ru">Kinokombinat</a>. <a href="https://victim.team">victim.team</a> is the crew I make things with.</p>
    <p><a href="/printor/">printor</a> makes video and stills look printed and scanned. <a href="/glyph-art/">glyph art</a> rebuilds an image out of glyphs sized by tone. Both run entirely in your browser, upload nothing, and cost nothing. The rest are under <a href="/tools/">tools</a>, and the instructions are in <a href="/articles/">articles</a>.</p>
    <p>The long version is in the <a href="/cv.pdf">CV (PDF)</a>.</p>
  </div>
